  "notes": "更新、连接与卸载更省心。\n\n- 更新包下载并校验完成后如果安装没能启动，现在可以直接重试安装，不用重新下载；Android 会在下载前先提醒开启「安装未知应用」权限。\n- 桌面端连接在等待系统授权时会明确提示，并可以随时取消。\n- Windows 卸载时会关闭悦通留下的系统代理并停止后台网络服务，不再出现卸载后无法上网。\n- Windows 上如果系统里残留了其他软件的自动代理脚本（PAC），悦通会提示流量可能没有经过它。\n- 登录后拉取订阅更快，不再被语言设置同步拖住。\n",
  "notesEn": "Smoother updates, connects and uninstalls.\n\n- If a verified update fails to open the installer, you can now retry the install without downloading again; Android asks for the \"install unknown apps\" permission before the download starts.\n- On desktop, a connection waiting for system authorization now says so and can be cancelled at any time.\n- Uninstalling on Windows now turns off the system proxy YueLink set and stops its background network service, so the machine is not left without internet.\n- On Windows, YueLink now warns when a leftover automatic proxy script (PAC) from another app may be diverting traffic.\n- Subscriptions load faster after sign-in and no longer wait on the language-preference sync.\n",
